[7.491979, "o", "I ran all seven commands in `/work`. Each output is below.\r\n\r\n**`ls -la`**\r\n```\r\ntotal 0\r\ndrwx------ 1 70002 70002  44 Nov  5 15:49 .\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 9     0     0 260 Nov  5 15:49 ..\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 70002 70002  64 Nov  5 15:49 .pytest_cache\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 70002 70002  44 Nov  5 15:49 calc\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 70002 70002  46 Nov  5 15:49 tests\r\n```\r\n\r\n**`cat calc/__init__.py`**\r\n```\r\ndef add(a, b, c=0):\r\n    return a + b + c\r\n```\r\n\r\n**`grep -rn 'def ' .`**\r\n```\r\n./calc/__init__.py:1:def add(a, b, c=0):\r\n./tests/test_calc.py:4:def test_add_positive_numbers():\r\n./tests/test_calc.py:8:def test_add_negative_numbers():\r\n./tests/test_calc.py:12:def test_add_with_third_argument():\r\n./tests/test_calc.py:16:def test_add_third_argument_defaults_to_zero():\r\n```\r\n\r\n**`find . -name '*.py'`**\r\n```\r\n./calc/__init__.py\r\n./tests/test_calc.py\r\n```\r\n\r\n**`sed -n '1,5p' tests/test_calc.py`**\r\n```\r\nfrom calc import add\r\n\r\n\r\ndef test_add_positive_numbers():\r\n    assert add(2, 3) == 5\r\n```\r\n\r\n**`wc -l calc/__init__.py tests/test_calc.py`**\r\n```\r\n  2 calc/__init__.py\r\n 17 tests/test_calc.py\r\n 19 total\r\n```\r\n\r\n**`diff calc/__init__.py tests/test_calc.py`**\r\n```\r\n1,2c1,17\r\n< def add(a, b, c=0):\r\n<     return a + b + c\r\n---\r\n> from calc import add\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> def test_add_positive_numbers():\r\n>     assert add(2, 3) == 5\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> def test_add_negative_numbers():\r\n>     assert add(-4, -6) == -10\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> def test_add_with_third_argument():\r\n>     assert add(1, 2, 3) == 6\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> def test_add_third_argument_defaults_to_zero():\r\n>     assert add(2, 3) == add(2, 3, 0) == 5\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe diff exits with differences because the two files have different content. The project is small: `calc/__init__.py` defines `add(a, b, c=0)`, and `tests/test_calc.py` has four tests for it. There is also a `.pytest_cache` directory, so pytest has been run here before.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
